# Fixed defect 580, 2026-10-10 (panel 207 R3; the critic's `s06`): an index is
# not an operator of spec § 7's table, and the walk gives an array no value,
# so `xs[5]` of a three-element array is not judged when the program is
# compiled. It aborts where `V` is read (spec § 10: an out-of-bounds index
# aborts), the `1` before it flushed first.

constant V: i64
    xs = [1, 2, 3]
    xs[5]

function main()
    print(1)
    print(V)
